{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01279",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.55,
      "end_seconds": 9.78,
      "duration_seconds": 9.23,
      "text": "Doctor, the patient's with us now. I did the usual checks at the front, so just say when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 11.37,
      "end_seconds": 16.09,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Welcome, tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 17.53,
      "end_seconds": 28.63,
      "duration_seconds": 11.1,
      "text": "Doctor, I've come along because I know the history, if it helps. We came because of a burn on my forearm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.57,
      "end_seconds": 33.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.32,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.75,
      "end_seconds": 38.58,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "I take sitagliptin, 100 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 40.5,
      "end_seconds": 45.79,
      "duration_seconds": 5.29,
      "text": "That's what's prescribed, but I'm not sure she takes it every day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.05,
      "end_seconds": 49.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.45,
      "text": "Levetiracetam I don't take anymore."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 51.56,
      "end_seconds": 53.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "When did this begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.1,
      "end_seconds": 58.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "About three days, give or take."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 59.71,
      "end_seconds": 63.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.3,
      "text": "Hm, I'd say more like five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.76,
      "end_seconds": 69.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.64,
      "text": "Okay, so roughly three to five days. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 71.16,
      "end_seconds": 73.02,
      "duration_seconds": 1.86,
      "text": "That sounds about right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.38,
      "end_seconds": 76.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Have you tried anything for it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.63,
      "end_seconds": 82.15,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Only cool water, and it's not much."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.92,
      "end_seconds": 90.65,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Yeah, and the other thing I wanted to mention is that I can't really—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 90.75,
      "end_seconds": 96.54,
      "duration_seconds": 5.79,
      "text": "Tell the doctor about the other thing, that's what worries me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 98.49,
      "end_seconds": 101.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.54,
      "text": "I was getting to that!"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.87,
      "end_seconds": 106.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine, one at a time. I'll ask about everything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.72,
      "end_seconds": 114.16,
      "duration_seconds": 5.44,
      "text": "And there's stinging pain as well, about a month now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "UNKNOWN",
      "start_seconds": 115.35,
      "end_seconds": 119.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "Yes, that's right, that's how it was."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.87,
      "end_seconds": 127.74,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "A few quick ones: numbness at the burn, burn to the face or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.72,
      "end_seconds": 143.37,
      "duration_seconds": 14.65,
      "text": "No, no numbness at the burn, no burn to the face, no fever. I did have a blister at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 143.9,
      "end_seconds": 148.84,
      "duration_seconds": 4.94,
      "text": "Any change in your bowel habit or your stomach generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 150.01,
      "end_seconds": 152.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.05,
      "text": "No, all normal there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.88,
      "end_seconds": 157.39,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.3,
      "end_seconds": 160.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.79,
      "text": "My cousin has psoriasis."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 172.07,
      "end_seconds": 172.98,
      "duration_seconds": 0.91,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.21,
      "end_seconds": 178.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.06,
      "end_seconds": 182.01,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.55,
      "end_seconds": 185.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.18,
      "end_seconds": 188.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Do you live by yourself?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 189.23,
      "end_seconds": 193.04,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 194.86,
      "end_seconds": 198.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "Are there any allergies I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 199.94,
      "end_seconds": 202.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "No allergies at all."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 203.4,
      "end_seconds": 211.29,
      "duration_seconds": 7.89,
      "text": "Hold on, doctor, I think she reacted to naproxen once. I'm not certain, though."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.31,
      "end_seconds": 215.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "I don't remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 215.96,
      "end_seconds": 219.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.51,
      "text": "Fair enough, I'll write down both versions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.04,
      "end_seconds": 236.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.14,
      "text": "Tell me about any past illnesses or ongoing conditions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 237.67,
      "end_seconds": 246.51,
      "duration_seconds": 8.84,
      "text": "I have heart failure, for about ten years. My neighbour said I should get it looked at."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.16,
      "end_seconds": 249.65,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "Okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.68,
      "end_seconds": 255.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "I've, I've got epilepsy. Yes, diabetes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 255.77,
      "end_seconds": 266.07,
      "duration_seconds": 10.3,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Pressure 128 over 79, SpO2 99 percent on room air, pulse is 69 beats a minute, temp 36.5 degrees."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.74,
      "end_seconds": 268.76,
      "duration_seconds": 1.02,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 270.03,
      "end_seconds": 272.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 273.79,
      "end_seconds": 274.73,
      "duration_seconds": 0.94,
      "text": "That's alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.65,
      "end_seconds": 277.92,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Does that hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 290.01,
      "end_seconds": 296.75,
      "duration_seconds": 6.74,
      "text": "It's a small superficial burn with an intact blister, about the size of a palm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 298.87,
      "end_seconds": 306.44,
      "duration_seconds": 7.57,
      "text": "Please sit back down. So where does that leave us? This is probably a minor superficial burn."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 307.13,
      "end_seconds": 309.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.11,
      "text": "Is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.84,
      "end_seconds": 323.29,
      "duration_seconds": 13.45,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a minor superficial burn. Let's use paracetamol, 1 gram, every six hours when needed, three days. It's for burn pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.8,
      "end_seconds": 326.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Thank you, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 327.24,
      "end_seconds": 342.33,
      "duration_seconds": 15.09,
      "text": "Cool it under running water for twenty minutes if it happens again, and leave the blister intact. Do get help quickly if the area becomes red and hot. We'll catch up in two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_6",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 343.99,
      "end_seconds": 349.27,
      "duration_seconds": 5.28,
      "text": "I'll book your follow-up at the front desk on your way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 349.88,
      "end_seconds": 351.8,
      "duration_seconds": 1.92,
      "text": "Alright, I'll be back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.55,
      "end_seconds": 357.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Is there anything you'd like me to go over again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 358.16,
      "end_seconds": 361.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "No, that's all. Thanks a lot."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 361.66,
      "end_seconds": 362.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.21,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}